      483.55,
      542.54,
      568.69
    ],
    "text": "By virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 27(1) read with Section 21 of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, 1, Harini Amarasuriya, Minister of Education, Higher Education and Vocational Education on the recommendation of the University Grants Commission, do by this Order, amend the Schedule to the Order made under Section 21 of the said Act, published in Gazette Extraordinary, No. 1093/8 of August 17, 1999, (as amended from time to time) establishing the Wayamba University of Sri Lanka, by the substitution for the entry \u201cDepartment of Applied Nutrition\u201d appearing in Column 2, which corresponds to the entry \u201cFaculty of Livestock, Fisheries and Nutrition\u201d appearing in Column 1 of the Schedule of the following entry :-",
